cture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Flail\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Generic_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Flail\" title=\"Electrified Flail\">Electrified Flail</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Clout a foe with your lightning-suffused flail and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stun\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stun</a> them. </dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/38px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/50px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Air Myrmidons\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidons</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is item cannot be obtained without exploits, because Air Myrmidons are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/25px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/38px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/50px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanently Armed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp/25px-Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Permanently_Armed_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\">Permanently Armed</a>.\n<ul><li>A previous exploit involving getting the myrmidon arrested has been patched out.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The version carried by NPC Myrmidons (as opposed to wildshape or player summons) is neither enchanted, nor deals elemental damage.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Electrified Flail:</i></p>\n<ul><li>This weapon action has no recharge time or other limitations and is strictly better than the myrmidon's standard attack.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This weapon grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tenacity (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/20px-Tenacity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/30px-Tenacity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/40px-Tenacity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tenacity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/20px-Tenacity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tenacity (passive feature)\">Tenacity</a> passive, but as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity\" title=\"Tenacity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/20px-Tenacity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/30px-Tenacity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/40px-Tenacity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tenacity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp/20px-Tenacity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Tenacity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity\" title=\"Tenacity\">Tenacity</a> reaction is not usable while polymorphed it will never trigger.</li></ul>\n\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 162px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 160px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"3d model by Brodie Keall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg/240px-Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg/360px-Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg/480px-Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"3d model by Brodie Keall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg/240px-Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Brodie-keall-flail-1.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">3d model by Brodie Keall</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201435\nCache expiry: 86400\nRedu